Source: SEBook/tools/java.md
URL: https://github.com/tobiasduerschmid/tobiasduerschmid.github.io/blob/24db6bf0d4e4ebfa1331e6c772e1844cbaf2d9aa/SEBook/tools/java.md

SEBook > tools > Java > Java Design Principles {#} > Top 10 Java Best Practices > 2. Make fields `private`; validate in setters and constructors

```java
// ✓ Encapsulation with validation — callers can't bypass the contract
